@startuml
actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant "ML Model" as ML
participant Database

User -> Frontend: Select event, buy ticket
Frontend -> Backend: POST /purchase
Backend -> ML: Predict price/fraud
ML --> Backend: Prediction result
Backend -> Database: Create ticket, log purchase
Database --> Backend: Confirmation
Backend --> Frontend: Purchase result
Frontend --> User: Show ticket/confirmation
@enduml
